  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{業務|ぎょうむ}{妨害|ぼうがい} - obstruction of business\n・{選挙|せんきょ}{妨害|ぼうがい} - election interference\n・{電波|でんぱ}{妨害|ぼうがい} - radio interference/jamming\n・{捜査|そうさ}{妨害|ぼうがい} - obstruction of investigation\n・{公務|こうむ}{執行|しっこう}{妨害|ぼうがい} - obstruction of justice\n\nLEGAL USAGE:\nCommonly used in legal contexts:\n・{威力|いりょく}{業務|ぎょうむ}{妨害|ぼうがい}{罪|ざい} - forcible obstruction of business (a crime)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n・{阻止|そし} - prevention, stopping\n・{邪魔|じゃま} - hindrance (more casual)",
